  "notes": "{間|ま}もなく means \"soon\" or \"shortly\"—more formal than ⟦もうすぐ→もうすぐ：01218_mousugu⟧.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {間|ま}もなく: soon, shortly (formal)\n- ⟦もうすぐ→もうすぐ：01218_mousugu⟧: soon (casual)\n- ⟦すぐ→すぐ：00814_sugu⟧: immediately, right away\n- ⟦そのうち→そのうち：00380_sonouchi⟧: before long, sometime (vague)\n\nUSAGE:\nOften heard in public announcements:\n- {間|ま}もなく⟦{電車|でんしゃ}→電車：00522_densha⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{参|まい}ります→参る：01322_mairu⟧ (The train will arrive shortly)\n- {間|ま}もなく⟦{開演|かいえん}→開演：23500_kaien⟧⟦です→です：09485_desu⟧ (The show will begin shortly)\n\nETYMOLOGY:\nLiterally \"without interval\" ({間|ま} = interval + ⟦も→も：00484_mo⟧⟦なく→ない：01118_nai⟧ = without).",
